	(text "BPW34 at zero bias into an MCP6002 transimpedance amp. Vout = I_photo x Rf.\n47k || 1nF: full scale 70 uA (about 175 uW at 635 nm), 3.4 kHz bandwidth.\nBuild two: reference (control board J8 -> ADS1115 A0) and output (J9 -> A1).\nIf a channel saturates, fit a smaller Rf and change PD_*_TIA_OHMS in config.h."
